          "name": "What NEET score do I need to get into MBBS abroad?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For MBBS abroad (Russia, Uzbekistan, Kazakhstan, Vietnam, Europe, Georgia etc.), you need a minimum NEET score of 150-160 for the General category, per current NMC guidelines. Individual universities may set higher thresholds. Students scoring 140–550 can have the widest range of MBBS options abroad."
