          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the FMGE test?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Foreign Medical Graduate Examination (FMGE) is the medical licensing exam of India conducted by the National Medical Commission for Students who have completed their MBBS degree from abroad, so that they can do clinical practice back in India."
