          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is it better to study MBBS in India or abroad?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "MBBS abroad can be a better option for Indian students than in India, as there are limited seats available in Indian medical colleges, and the level of competition is also intense in India. Medical universities abroad provide every opportunity for Indian students to receive the best medical education at low MBBS fees."
